SECTION 3 PRODUCT AND TECHNOLOGY

Platform overview plain language: SocioProphet installs a governed AI control plane inside a regulated institution's own cloud environment. It runs a curated set of proven AI models and a fleet of specialised agents for research, analysis, workflow, and customer-facing tasks entirely within the institution's walls. Every decision the system makes produces a signed, replayable evidence record. The institution gets frontier-grade AI capability without their data ever leaving, and with every AI action provable to any auditor or regulator.

Three components working together:

1. Cybernetic Control Plane - the orchestration and governance layer deployed inside the customer's own private cloud (AWS, Azure, or on-premise). It decides which model handles which task, routes work to the cheapest safe lane, enforces the institution's policies, and keeps the entire AI estate behaving as a single governed system. No external API calls. No data leaves the perimeter.

2. Governed Model Stable and Agent Fleet - proven open-weight foundation models (Llama, Mistral, and equivalents) deployed entirely inside the customer's environment, customised and enriched on the institution's own data. Specialised agents for research, analysis, workflow, and customer-facing tasks run on top. The institution owns its AI brain.

3. Evidence Fabric - every action produces a cryptographically signed, replayable artifact. Uncertainty is propagated with full provenance to the decision surface, never collapsed into a traffic light. Any decision can be replayed and audited: which model was used, whether it was authorised, what the policy decision was, how confident the system was.

The primary value-delivering feature: the evidence fabric. This is the structural production of cryptographically signed, replayable evidence artifacts at every model call and agent decision, with uncertainty propagated rather than collapsed. It directly answers the question every regulated institution dreads: "Prove what your AI did, whether it was authorised, and how confident it was." [Flagged as inferred from documents - confirm with Michael as the definitive answer in session.]

Three key differentiators a competitor could not copy in six months:
1. Uncertainty as a first-class primitive - uncertainty propagated with full provenance to the decision surface, never collapsed. Genuinely unique across all four competitive categories.
2. Evidence by architecture - governance is structural, not added on. Signed, replayable artifacts are produced by the execution itself, not by a monitoring layer placed on top.
3. Sovereign and current, simultaneously - resolves the binary that forces institutions to choose between control and frontier capability. The managed-currency service delivers both at once.

The technical differentiator the founders claim: neurosymbolic reasoning substrate.
